The '''Confederate States of Sanrobonia''' ('''CSS''') ('''[[Sanrobonian language|Sanrobonian]]''': ᨀᨚᨊᨛᨄᨛᨉᨛᨑᨔᨗ ᨔᨋᨚᨅᨚᨊᨗᨕ Konfederasi Sanrobonia), also known as '''Sanrobonia''' or '''Confedracy of Sanrobonia''', is a [[w:Sovereign state|sovereign state]] primarly located in [[Sanrobone]] in coast of northeastern [[Shendan Ocean]]. It is a {{W|federal republic|federal republic}} of 30 [[Sanrobonian States|States]]
